00:01:41.870 --> 00:01:43.267
- [India] Yes.

00:01:43.267 --> 00:01:46.510
- Money in and profit

00:01:46.510 --> 00:01:47.957
post money in.

00:01:47.957 --> 00:01:51.632
And I'm actually making a
