had a business meeting.

00:01:53.999 --> 00:01:56.005
I think a lot of people have metrics

00:01:56.005 --> 00:01:57.080
for the sake of metrics.

00:01:57.080 --> 00:01:58.579
Marketing for the 
sake of marketing.

00:01:58.579 --> 00:02:00.793
If you have a business 
the only metric

00:02:00.793 --> 00:02:02.021
that you should be 
paying attention to

00:02:02.021 --> 00:02:04.906
